// Archive Utility or Explorer Spawning a LOLBin - SideCopy / APT36 Delivery
// Source rule: ../sigma/office_archive_lnk_spawns_lolbin.yml
// SCHEMA: ECS / Elastic Defend (Elastic Agent endpoint integration). Fields are
//   ECS (process.name, process.parent.name). The raw Winlogbeat Sysmon path
//   (winlog.event_data.*) is NOT covered by these queries - it needs its own
//   field mapping, which is not provided here.
// Rule type: EQL | Index: logs-endpoint.events.process-*
// SCOPE: parent-child (archive/Explorer -> LOLBin) from a single event. Does not
//   prove the full ZIP->LNK->payload chain; ".lnk" is investigation context.

process where event.type == "start"
  and process.parent.name : ("explorer.exe", "7zFM.exe", "WinRAR.exe", "Winzip.exe")
  and process.name : ("mshta.exe", "powershell.exe", "pwsh.exe", "rundll32.exe", "cmd.exe")
